  "upload/8b/035728b2151de044fb245988ec5f33ebb544ab": {
   "111907": "Haruhi (GP Test),LIANGGONGCHUNRI,\"A hero who crossed over from another world and the leader of the SOS Brigade. She has the power to rewrite the world however she likes and has turned this world into a lively place too, though she's completely unaware of it.\",Unabashed Hero,All-Out Attack!,\"Swings the Hero's Sword (SOS Brigade Leader exclusive) with all her might, inflicting Fire damage on nearby foes / Increases skill damage for all units in your party\",All-Out Attack!+,\"Swings the Hero's Sword (SOS Brigade Leader exclusive) with all her might, inflicting Fire damage on nearby foes / Increases skill damage for all units in your party\",(None),(None),Power to Liven Up the World,Aya Hirano"
  },
