  "upload/b4/a28679b8eeefdbdcbe6071fd4f2ff85e5b3415": {
   "111907": "0,0,,This place is SO much fun! There's something new to discover every day. I'm completely satisfied!,home/kokotte_hontoni\n0,2,,\"We have to eat before we go adventuring. How does that old saying go? \"\"An army marches on its...\"\" whatever. Hurry, bring all the good food!\",home/bokennomaeni\n0,2,,\"Say, are there any bandits around here? Think about it—if they're the bad guys, we don't have to hold back. We can just go raid them, right?\",home/neenee_dokkani\n0,1,,\"Aaah, that was a blast! I wonder what fun stuff will happen tomorrow! Huh? Why are you all collapsed on the floor?\",home/a_tanoshikatta\n0,1,,\"Today we're exploring a brand-new area! Of course, everyone's coming. No objections. An adventure's only worth it if we all go!\",home/kyowaatarashiieriao\n0,1,,\"Kyon, your shield's falling apart. How are you supposed to defend with that? I'll pick out a sturdier one for you next time...\",home/kyonnotate_boroboro\n2,,,\"I'm Haruhi Suzumiya, leader of the SOS Brigade! I have no interest in ordinary humans. Are you an alien? A time traveler? An esper? Or someone from another world?\",ally/join\n1,,1,You guys are pretty capable! I like you! I'll make an exception and let you join the SOS Brigade as honorary members of our Other World Branch!,ally/evolution"
  },
